  "Efficient congruencing gives sharp mean values via p-adic concentration iteration; ES solution counts mod prime powers have a p-adic concentration structure (Hensel lifts of certificates).",
  "Moment bounds Σ f(n)^k with sharp exponents constrain the distribution of R(p).",
  "Compute numerically Σ_{n ≤ N} f(n)^2, f(n)^3 and fit exponents of log N; compare with decoupling-type predictions.",
  ["Wooley, Nested efficient congruencing and relatives of Vinogradov's mean value theorem, Proc. LMS 118 (2019)"],
