  "Apply the distortion method bound to the repo's identity menus mod M and compare the predicted uncovered density with the measured one.",
  ["Hough, Solution of the minimum modulus problem for covering systems, Ann. Math. 181 (2015), arXiv:1307.0874", "Balister–Bollobás–Morris–Sahasrabudhe–Tiba, On the Erdős covering problem: the density of the uncovered set, arXiv:1811.03547"],
